{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quantum Beast focuses on rumble fighting that you need to fight against massive enemies ALONE. So if you are confident of your power, then go for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Elements:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cool Fighting Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick the robots in the ass! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the core mechanic that you can counter enemy's attacks to blow them in the air. And after that, a heavy strike kick could teach then a good lesson.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893000/extras/e432f973d28e7a485a203f561c4c07f8.poster.avif?t=1757904981\" width=720 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893000/extras/e432f973d28e7a485a203f561c4c07f8.webm?t=1757904981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893000/extras/e432f973d28e7a485a203f561c4c07f8.mp4?t=1757904981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw them toward the wall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash the enemies away. When they hit the wall, the additional stamina damage could stun them more easily. And may get chances to execute continuously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893000/extras/294d42097b5599966da2fdc9b29a3dbf.poster.avif?t=1757904981\" width=720 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893000/extras/294d42097b5599966da2fdc9b29a3dbf.webm?t=1757904981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893000/extras/294d42097b5599966da2fdc9b29a3dbf.mp4?t=1757904981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-Weapon System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can switch between several main weapon at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893000/extras/b75d0633a4836de11dd84c4b163cb45c.poster.avif?t=1757904981\" width=720 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893000/extras/b75d0633a4836de11dd84c4b163cb45c.webm?t=1757904981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893000/extras/b75d0633a4836de11dd84c4b163cb45c.mp4?t=1757904981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Sub Weapons </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot or explode, your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893000/extras/49a24e74ab75e5474772102013a73bab.poster.avif?t=1757904981\" width=720 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893000/extras/49a24e74ab75e5474772102013a73bab.webm?t=1757904981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893000/extras/49a24e74ab75e5474772102013a73bab.mp4?t=1757904981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quantum Blade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl